Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: FreeDCE
Source: https://sourceforge.net/projects/freedce/
Comment: FreeDCE 2.0.0, 64-bit port, installed below /opt/dce.
 The tree combines code under several licenses; the paragraphs below follow
 the notices in the files.  Files without a notice of their own fall under
 the statement in README (LicenseRef-FreeDCE-README), except in dcethreads,
 whose COPYING places the whole package under the GNU General Public License.
 Binary packages: freedce (libdcerpc, libdcethreads, protocol modules, rpcd,
 uuid), freedce-dev (dceidl, headers, IDL files), freedce-examples (echo,
 samr, liblsarpc).  The NTLMSSP and GSS authentication modules
 (freedce/ncklib/auth), DCOM (freedce/dcom), netlogon and the tests are part
 of the source only; they are not built into the packages.
 .
 freedce/COPYING begins with the sentence "Basically, you can't distribute
 this for money."  It is a historical note; none of the licenses below
 contains such a restriction.

